This directory contains the coefficient tables for different symmetry types.
These are compiled into the executable code: the Hamiltonian and global-operator
tables are statements interpreted through c++/table_terms.hpp, the recalculation
tables are rows included in c++/symmetry/nrg-recalc-*.hpp.

Exception: the tables of none, p, u1, qsz, and spu1 are no longer compiled. For these
symmetry types the tables are generated at run time for any number of channels
(c++/abelian_shell.hpp). They are kept as the reference for
test/unit/symmetry/abelian_shell.cpp.

This version has been cleaned up (somewhat) and tested to run correctly with 
Mathematica 13.1 in May 2023.

Rok Zitko